// rate = the highest single-game, single-sub-area, single-condition slot
// total ("up to N%"), capped at 100 — games are never summed together.
// "Gift"/"Static"/"NPC Trade" methods are kept (they are what makes a
// starter's home town appear here). The Found In popup renders these; a
// bare string (pre-0.2.7 entry, populate_hisui_species.js) still renders
// as just the name.

